  "abstract": "This ablation study investigates the sensitivity of the Learnable Gamma Fourier Forecaster (Lumina I's ID 443) to its dropout rate. We reduce the dropout rate from 0.05 to 0.04, retaining all other optimal parameters (`proj_rank=36`, `hidden_size=160`, `lr=9e-4`). This experiment aims to provide further empirical data for our upcoming publication, assessing the robustness of the model's performance to minor regularization adjustments.",
